        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek E4020, Modern Touchscreen Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Electronic Keypad Lock has a EMTOUCH keypad for easy access. Instead of carrying around keys, all you need is a single code. The Touchscreen Leverset can be programmed with up to 20 codes and comes factory programmed with 2 unique codes so you can use your new handleset right away. The modern look of this EMTOUCH Modern Electronic Keypad Leverset makes it a great choice for home remodels. Choose your favorite  modern finish.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek E4020 Touchscreen Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to use installation and programming instructions included.</li> \r\n<li>Factory programmed with 2 unique, secure user codes for use right out of the box.</li> \r\n<li>Can be programmed with up to 20 user codes of your choice.</li> \r\n<li>Codes can be added and deleted.</li> \r\n<li>Easy lock operation, simply push the Emtek button and turn the exterior thumb turn to lock.</li> \r\n<li>Easy unlock operation, enter the 4 digit code and turn the lever.</li> \r\n<li>Interior Thumbturn controls passage feature</li> \r\n<li>Programming changes can be made easily using the keypad.</li> \r\n<li>Sleek keypad has a protective coating to prevent wear patterns.</li> \r\n<li>Illuminated keypad for easy and quick operation after dark.</li> \r\n<li>Low battery indicator lets you know when it’s time to change the battery.</li> \r\n<li>Emtek’s standard mechanical and finish warranties along with a 2 year warranty on electronic components. </li> \r\n<li>Backup Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Touchpad Electronic Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Package includes: 2 levers, latch, strike plate, and 9-volt battery.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-E4020-specifications.pdf?v=1774588031\"><b>Emtek E4020 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
